<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carmike cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carmike cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Carmike Cinemas Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and still rates it a long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Monday at 27-1/8.</p>
</text>
